      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Krea 2 Turbo — 3-step distill LoRA, LOCAL (i2i)\n\nAuthor's stock workflow + our wiring. Contract: **3 steps, cfg 1.0, euler/simple, LoRA @ 1.0** (cfg 1.0 = no guidance; cfg 0.0 BREAKS the image).\n\n- UNET `krea2_turbo_bf16` (author's validated build; swap to `krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled` to halve VRAM — author: fp8 fine on NVIDIA)\n- LoRA `krea2_turbo_3step_rank_64_lora_comfyui` @ 1.0 (lvladikov, chk00012000)\n- CLIP `qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled` (ours; author's bf16 not present)\n- VAE `qwen_image_vae` (official, present)\n- i2i: `char1_sheet.png` → VAEEncode → KSampler, **denoise 0.7** (dial: 0.5 = closer to the sheet, 0.85 = freer scene)\n- prompt = Jaisal rainy street (D137), single-character guard (Krea2 duplicate quirk)\n- SaveImage prefix `krea2_3step_`\n\nAuthor's known issues: texture ~1.15× stronger than teacher, faint doubled edges, 3 steps ≠ 8-step picture at same seed.\nBonus mode (author): also loads on `krea2_raw_bf16` at 13 steps CFG 3.5 (unsupported mode, CFG must stay on)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
